	(text "Keys: MX switches (HanElectricity CPG151101D13,\nLCSC C49234235) in CPG151101S11-16 hot-swap sockets, a 1206\nwarm-white LED in each switch's LED slot (3.3 V, 100 R: ~4-6 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26f8aba0-228d-410e-b095-433c87a95f5f")
	)
	(text "Power: 5 V from the solder pads (J2) or the optional USB-C (J3), never both and never with\nthe panel's own USB. No reverse-polarity protection: mark + and - clearly. The panel is fed\nthrough J1; U1 makes 3.3 V for the co-processor, radar and SHT40."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b05f4601-88cb-44e1-b709-541a05fe17d8")
	)
	(text "Radar: HLK-LD2402 soldered on its own 2.5 mm header, antenna side out, on a break-away piece at the bar's left end, under key 1 (snap it off to build\nwithout the radar).\nCheck the module's print: 1 VCC, 2 OUT, 3 GND, 4 TX, 5 RX (Hi-Link manual p. 7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf58be04-fedb-4ab0-8e68-d9634de77a10")
	)
	(text "Co-processor: CH32V003A4M6 (SOP-16), I2C slave to the panel; the panel polls it.\nSame pins on both boards: PC6/PC7/PC0 = key LEDs (TIM1 remap 1 PWM) or encoder 1 A/B and\nencoder 2 A; PC3/PA1/PC4 = keys 1-3 or encoder 1 push / encoder 2 B / encoder 2 push.\nFlash with a WCH-LinkE on J4 (SWIO, 3V3, GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e3ced4cc-98da-4139-a016-ff4a73af00f9")
	)
